---

### Layer Responsibilities

| Layer | Files | Responsibility | Must NOT |
|-------|-------|----------------|----------|
| **CLI** | `cli.rs` | Argument parsing, help, version | Business logic |
| **Commands** | `commands/*.rs` | Parse args → requests, prompts, output | Orchestration, crypto, I/O (partially deviated — see below) |
| **Application** | `application/*.rs` | Use case orchestration (`pack_bundle`, `run_bundle`) | Direct I/O, harness specifics |
| **Domain** | `domain/*.rs` | Types, validation, invariants | Any external dependency |
| **Harness** | `harness/*.rs` | Adapter implementations (`Harness` trait + registry) | Cross-harness logic |
| **Infrastructure** | `infrastructure/*.rs` | FS, archive, ignore, process | Domain logic |
| **Security** | `security/*.rs` | Crypto primitives | I/O, harness, domain logic |

